- Windows MDM hosts are now sent a per-device, single-use enroll secret instead of the shared global enroll secret when `auth.use_one_time_enroll_secrets` is enabled. The secret is minted per MDM enrollment and expanded when the fleetd install command is delivered, so it is no longer stored in plaintext in the MDM command queue or returned by the MDM command results API.
- Added `MsiHiddenProperties` for `FLEET_SECRET` to the Windows installer so the enroll secret no longer appears in verbose MSI logs.
